Declare the kotlin capabilities repo reproducible so it can use the repo contents cache.

It only renders checked-in templates using its own attributes, so it is trivially
reproducible.

Not yet raised upstream.

diff --git a/src/main/starlark/core/repositories/compiler.bzl b/src/main/starlark/core/repositories/compiler.bzl
index 2c947c6..98cea15 100755
--- a/src/main/starlark/core/repositories/compiler.bzl
+++ b/src/main/starlark/core/repositories/compiler.bzl
@@ -41,6 +41,12 @@ def _kotlin_capabilities_impl(repository_ctx):
         executable = False,
     )
 
+    # Bazel <8.3.0 lacks repository_ctx.repo_metadata
+    if not hasattr(repository_ctx, "repo_metadata"):
+        return None
+
+    return repository_ctx.repo_metadata(reproducible = True)
+
 def _get_capability_template(compiler_version, templates):
